@node Game Scripting Comprehensive Reference
@chapter Game Scripting Comprehensive Reference

This chapter provides complete documentation of 50+ commands across three classic game scripting languages:
Adventure Game Interpreter (AGI), Sierra Script (SCI), and Script Creation Utility for Maniac Mansion (SCUMM).
Each command includes complete syntax, numeric type specifications, real compilable examples, and language-specific
gotchas and features. This reference is designed for retro game developers targeting 8-bit and 16-bit platforms.

